"answer":[{"part":"Build procedure","ruling":"Choose a clearing you rule that has an open building slot, then choose the building type and take the leftmost building of that type from its track. Pay the cost shown atop that type's column by removing that amount of wood from the target clearing or from other clearings you rule that connect to it through an unbroken chain of ruled clearings. Place the building and score the VP shown on the newly uncovered track space. Building is not legal unless the full wood cost, building piece and legal slot are available.","evidence":"Marquise de Cat (6); Daylight Build action"}],
