"source_passages":[{"section":"Eyrie Dynasties (7); Birdsong","quotation":"**Birdsong, in order:**\n\n1. **Emergency Orders:** If hand empty, draw one.\n2. **Add to Decree:** Must add one or two hand cards, **at most one added bird card**. Each goes to any column; columns have no size limit.\n3. **A New Roost:** If no roosts on map, place one roost and three warriors in a corner that is not another player's starting corner, diagonally opposite a starting corner if possible."}],
"answer":[{"part":"Eyrie Birdsong and recovery placement","ruling":"In order: if the hand is empty, draw one card; add one or two hand cards to any Decree columns, with at most one bird card and no column size limit; then, if there are no roosts on the map, place one roost and three warriors in a corner that is not another player's starting corner, diagonally opposite a starting corner if possible.","evidence":"Eyrie Dynasties (7); Birdsong"}],
