{"part":"No matching card or full Supporters","ruling":"If the player has no matching card, including birds, they show their hand to the Alliance, which draws one card from the deck into Supporters. If Supporters is full, discard the incoming Outrage card; the payment or no-match draw still occurs.","evidence":"Woodland Alliance (8); Outrage"}
